{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37584","headline":"赵璘郎中席上赋蝴蝶 · 郑谷","name":"赵璘郎中席上赋蝴蝶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寻艳复寻香，似闲还似忙。\n暖烟沈蕙径，微雨宿花房。\n书幌轻随梦，歌楼误采粧。\n王孙深属意，绣入舞衣裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}